tion: ⋆_q ∘ ⋆_q = id. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalYangMills.qHodgeStar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalYangMills.qHodgeStar","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-self-duality.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The q-Hodge star ⋆_q : Ω² → Ω². ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalYangMills.curvature","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalYangMills.curvature","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-self-duality.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The curvature F_∇ : 𝟙 → curvatureSpace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalYangMills.antiSelfDualForms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalYangMills.antiSelfDualForms","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-self-duality.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The anti-self-dual 2-forms Ω⁻(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalYangMills.selfDualForms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalYangMills.selfDualForms","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-self-duality.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The self-dual 2-forms Ω⁺(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalYangMills.curvatureSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalYangMills.curvatureSpace","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-self-duality.lea